    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P. Marry & Associates presents to the market this recently renovated and upgraded two bedroom first floor apartment located on the South Strand overlooking the south beach and coastline. Within two minutes walking distance of all the town centre amenities and benefitting from secure off street parking, this spacious and well proportioned apartment presents in Showhouse condition. Boasting many special features including the panoramic views from the newly tiled balcony, quartz kitchen worktops, Quooker hot tap, new doors, skirtings electrical sockets and waterproof flooring to mention but a few, this property is guaranteed to impress all who view.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall:    Wood floor, recessed lights, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Living area:                                                                                                                                                                                                 Kitchen: (4.51m X 3.78m) Wall & floor mounted (newly fitted) units with quartz counter tops to include the breakfast counter, Quooker tap (hot/cold filter), Plumbed for dishwasher, washing machine and dryer.\r\nDining area: (1.66m X 2.96m) wood floor, built in storage.\r\nLiving area: (3.19m X 3.29m) T.V point , feature pannelled wall, patio door access to tiled balcony with panoramic coastline views.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom:    W.C., W.H.B. with feature vanity unit, wet room style shower unit with rainfall shower, Upright feature radiator, Wall cabinet, wall mirror, fully tiled walls and floor (all newly fitted)\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (4.57m X 2.68m)     Bult-in wardrobes, wood floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (2.79m X 3.45m)      Built-in wardrobes with vanity unit, wood floor\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nFront: Overlooking the south strand and promenade with  panoramic sea and coastline views.\r\nRear: Private (gated) off street parking,  storage shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Special features:\r\nPanoramic sea and coastline views\r\nTown centre location\r\nPrivate (gated) parking to the rear\r\nShed storage at rear\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nTriple glazed throughout\r\nNewly fitted kitchen\r\nNewly fitted bathroom/wet room"
      },
      {
